ich in Ariel, Tochter des Pfarrers, der Rockmusik als Teufelswerk geißelt. Bei einem Traktor-Duell besteht Ren eine Mutprobe und beginnt, die Jugend für die Durchführung einer öffentlichen Tanzveranstaltung zu begeistern. Der Stadtrat überstimmt den Antrag. Ren überzeugt den Pfarrer. Die große Fete findet in einer Fabrikhalle statt.","poster":"/zQwCUPm7SWfo7ZqzPlg6Dky1JD3.jpg","runtime":107.0,"title":"Footloose","type":"movie","va":6.7,"vc":2316,"year":"1984"},"movie:189215":{"cast":[{"id":1152,"name":"Oliver Stone","photo":"/zn4XrQMUg32poFHJd2kwlXBPmGg.jpg"},{"id":3331792,"name":"Vasili Arkhipov","photo":"/9iYJM3mAdYYpgelmZK7uPSdJIBG.jpg"},{"id":120578,"name":"Franklin D. Roosevelt","photo":"/jUNpoeappi9cc29JqEZe25rTU6b.jpg"},{"id":1666524,"name":"Henry A. Wallace","photo":"/zop28aRK8YHS8Ydhsx0m8q46XQY.jpg"},{"id":1247141,"name":"Harry S. Truman","photo":"/n4SZGM76DQ2ENMCgtakK3KOrC2v.jpg"},{"id":994271,"name":"Josef Stalin","photo":"/lXOn6MhSwB3idCyZrM58ZiKreCH.jpg"},{"id":1116399,"name":"Winston Churchill","photo":"/tpxNemRAcaRckG7kkPk5oRwKTim.jpg"},{"id":102786,"name":"Barack Obama","photo":"/reEkbvLlNknpCo2I37Vim6XpqGu.jpg"}],"genres":["Dokumentarfilm","Historie"],"id":189215,"original":"The Untold History Of The United States","overview":"","poster":"/qGiBpv3qKlJtBHA17xymVdN3U44.jpg","runtime":585.0,"title":"The Untold History Of The United States","type":"movie","va":8.2,"vc":112,"year":"2012"},"movie:197832":{"cast":[{"id":1504811,"name":"Ranodeep Bose","photo":""},{"id":1261153,"name":"Arpita Pal","photo":"/j4lugCX5XBhx6EHz7Woq0DVQqhp.jpg"},{"id":1185216,"name":"Roopa Ganguly","photo":"/vP534taJlk85GH53ZQ8NOYCtKEW.jpg"},{"id":2035791,"name":"Rita Koiral","photo":"/tdfvF4Uvy94wwqY790dGt1VKDsF.jpg"},{"id":1176773,"name":"Anjan Dutt","photo":"/lgCiLJXy1GfKpWRoRu6q4B6SAuy.jpg"},{"id":1323233,"name":"Shankar Chakraborty","photo":"/s7qwlr95FTZEiYdLsFNFecL9t0z.jpg"},{"id":1261148,"name":"Biswajit Chakraborty","photo":"/ojhY03OYjfGfdauuQAB13nM0HIK.jpg"},{"id":115142